        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 25 at 2:15AM CDT until September 25 at 11:00AM CDT by NWS Bismarck ND</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility one quarter mile or less in dense fog.

* WHERE...Portions of central North Dakota, including the James River
Valley.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM CDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your headlights, and leave plenty of
distance ahead of you.</instruction>
